.png?9c6ab1 2x\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"32\" /></a></td>\n<td><span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wowprogramming.com/docs/api/UnitHealth.html\">Wowprogramming</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>System: <a href=\"/wiki/Category:API_systems/Unit\" title=\"Category:API systems/Unit\">Unit</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Predicates\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Secret_Values#Secret_arguments\" title=\"Secret Values\"><span style=\"cursor: help; color: gray;\" title=\"Only accepts secret values if execution isn&#39;t tainted\">AllowedWhenUntainted</span></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SecretReturns\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table><div class=\"mobileonly noexcerpt\" data-nosnippet=\"\" style=\"text-align: right; font-size: smaller; margin-top: -8px; margin-right: 4px;\">\u2192 <a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft_API\" title=\"World of Warcraft API\">WoW API</a></div></div><div class=\"nomobile\"><div style=\"float: right; clear: right;\">\n<table class=\"darktable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Warcraft_Wiki:Interface_customization\" title=\"Warcraft Wiki:Interface customization\">Main Menu</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft_API\" title=\"World of Warcraft API\">WoW API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lua_functions\" title=\"Lua functions\">Lua API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Widget_API\" title=\"Widget API\">Widget API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/ScriptObject_API\" title=\"ScriptObject API\">ScriptObject API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/XML\" title=\"XML\">XML schema</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/FrameXML_functions\" title=\"FrameXML functions\">FrameXML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Events\" title=\"Events\">Events</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Console_variables\" title=\"Console variables\">CVars</a></li></ul>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/COMBAT_LOG_EVENT\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"COMBAT LOG EVENT\">Combat Log</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/UI_escape_sequences\" title=\"UI escape sequences\">Escape sequences</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/API_change_summaries\" title=\"API change summaries\">API changes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/HOWTOs\" title=\"HOWTOs\">HOWTOs</a></li>\n<li><img alt=\"Warcraft Wiki icon stamp.svg\" src=\"/images/Warcraft_Wiki_icon_stamp.svg?c7645a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /> <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.wiki.gg/redirect\">Redirect</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=warcraft.wiki.gg\">Google</a></span></li>\n<li><img alt=\"Discord logo.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Discord_logo.png/14px-Discord_logo.png?4d7bc2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"14\" height=\"11\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Discord_logo.png/21px-Discord_logo.png?4d7bc2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Discord_logo.png/28px-Discord_logo.png?4d7bc2 2x\" data-file-width=\"619\" data-file-height=\"469\" /> <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discord.gg/txUg39Vhc6\">WoWUIDev</a></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div>\n<p>Returns the current health of the unit.\n</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #3366cc; padding: 1px; min-width: clamp(0%, (100vw - 715px) * -9999, 50%); max-width: max-content;\" class=\"mw-highlight mw-highlight-lang-lua mw-content-ltr\" dir=\"ltr\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"nv\">health</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">UnitHealth</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">usePredicted</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n</pre></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Arguments\">Arguments</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/API:UnitHealth?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Arguments\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>unit</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"/wiki/UnitToken\" title=\"UnitToken\"><span style=\"color: var(--wowapi-text-color);\">UnitToken</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size: smaller;\">&#160;: <span style=\"color: var(--wowapi-text-color);\">string</span></span></dd>\n<dt>usePredicted</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"color: var(--wowapi-text-color);\">boolean</span><span title=\"nilable\">?</span> <code><span style=\"color: #dda0dd; font-size: smaller;\" title=\"default\">= true</span></code> - Predicts the values that would be returned from the server by using combat log information, so the health values will be more up-to-date. There are generally only advantages for using this.</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Returns\">Returns</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/API:UnitHealth?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Returns\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>health</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"color: var(--wowapi-text-color);\">number</span> - Returns <code>0</code> if the unit is dead or does not exist.</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/API:UnitHealth?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Details\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"darktable zebra\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 4px; padding-right: 1em; font-weight: bold;\">Related Events</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 4px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Event:UNIT_HEALTH\" title=\"Event:UNIT HEALTH\">UNIT_HEALTH</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 4px; padding-right: 1em; font-weight: bold;\">Available after</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 4px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Event:PLAYER_ENTERING_WORLD\" title=\"Event:PLAYER ENTERING WORLD\">PLAYER_ENTERING_WORLD</a> (on login)\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Patch_changes\">Patch changes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/API:UnitHealth?action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Patch changes\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Retail\"><font color=\"#4ec9b0\">Retail</font></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/API:UnitHealth?action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Retail\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 50px; text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Wrath_of_the_Lich_King\" title=\"Wrath of the Lich King\"><img alt=\"Wrath of the Lich King\" src=\"/images/Wrath-Logo-Small.png?6705fd\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"36\" height=\"19\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"19\" /></a></span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Patch_3.0.2/API_changes\" title=\"Patch 3.0.2/API changes\">Patch 3.0.2</a> (2008-10-14):</b> Returns absolute health instead of percentages for non party/raid units.   <i></i><br /></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Classic\"><font color=\"#4ec9b0\">Classic</font></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/API:UnitHealth?action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Classic\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 50px; text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Classic\" title=\"World of Warcraft: Classic\"><img alt=\"World of Warcraft: Classic\" src=\"/images/WoW_Icon_Classic.png?251bc2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"29\" height=\"17\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" data-file-width=\"29\" data-file-height=\"17\" /></a></span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Patch_1.13.3/API_changes\" title=\"Patch 1.13.3/API changes\">Patch 1.13.3</a> (2019-12-10):</b> Returns absolute health values for NPCs to alleviate addon comms load from the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/real-mob-health\">Real Mob Health</a> addon. Still returns health percentages for players. <small>(Hotfix during build 33302, Feb 7 2020)</small> <sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>   <i></i><br /></li>\n<li><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 50px; text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Classic\" title=\"World of Warcraft: Classic\"><img alt=\"World of Warcraft: Classic\" src=\"/images/WoW_Icon_Classic.png?251bc2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"29\" height=\"17\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" data-file-width=\"29\" data-file-height=\"17\" /></a></span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Patch_1.13.2/API_changes\" title=\"Patch 1.13.2/API changes\">Patch 1.13.2</a> (2019-08-26):</b> Added. Shows health percentages for non party/raid units.   <i></i><br /></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/API:UnitHealth?action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: References\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"font-size:calc(80% + 2.1px);\"><div style=\"margin-top:-0.3em; margin-bottom:0px; height:0px\">&#160;</div><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\">Kaivax&#32;2020-02-18.&#32;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/wow-classic-ui-api-change-for-unithealth/446596\">UI API Change for UnitHealth</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260918125637\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no\u2010toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.167 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.469 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 542/1000000\nRevision size: 1456/4194304 bytes\nPost\u2010expand include size: 18491/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1572/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post\u2010expand size: 1112/10000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/5000\nLua time usage: 0.123/15.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 12663075/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  398.598      1 -total\n 85.24%  339.749      1 Template:Wowapi\n  3.47%   13.836      3 Template:Apitype\n  3.24%   12.929      2 Template:Apirow\n  1.87%    7.443      3 Template:Patch\n  1.60%    6.396      1 Template:Apisig\n  1.56%    6.224      1 Template:Patch_1.13.3\n  1.50%    5.991      1 Template:Reflist\n  1.46%    5.815      1 Template:Patch_3.0.2\n  1.35%    5.377      2 Template:Api\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key warcraft_en:pcache:idhash:3417-0!canonical and timestamp 20260918125636 and revision id 6817607. Rendering was triggered because: edit-page\n -->\n</div>"},"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Arguments","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"API:UnitHealth","byteoffset":126,"anchor":"Arguments","linkAnchor":"Arguments"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Returns","number":"2","index":"2","fromtitle":"API:UnitHealth","byteoffset":41